{
  "schema": "mako-cases-r87-v1",
  "notes": "Frozen C1 case set for round 87, authored from the pinned mako(5) manual alone (installed mako 1.11.0-1; /usr/share/man/man5/mako.5.gz; sha256 of the decompressed manual = f717848f47cc7739d4bddbcc08c133a32e0d7dface7d1769882da1a0150477ba). Each case carries its own HOME fixture, its own --config path relative to HOME, the notification fields, and the expected effective values, and is pinned to one manual line. args keys and case ids follow the loader of quality/counters/c1-r87-mako-criteria.py (app-name, urgency, mode).",
